
cp file1 file2  --> it will create another copy of file1 if file2 doesn't exist
                --> it will copy content of file1 to file2 if file2 is already exists but data in file2 will be overridden


cat file1 > file2  --> it will create another copy of file1 if file2 doesn't exist
                   --> it will copy content of file1 to file2 if file2 is already exists but data in file2 will be overridden


cat file1 >> file2  --> to concat file1 data to file2 data


cat file1.txt file2.txt > combined.txt   --> Concatenate content of file1 and file2 to combined file


cp file1 file2 folder  --> to copy files to folder, folder should be present 
